{
  "answer": "You can declare a reusable dependency with `Depends` by importing it directly from `fastapi` and passing a callable as a parameter. For example:\n```python\nfrom fastapi import Depends\n\ndef get_db():\n    # database connection logic\n    pass\n\ndb = Depends(get_db)\n```\nThis way, you can use the `db` dependency in your path operations, and FastAPI will take care of calling the `get_db` function with the correct parameters. [tutorial/dependencies/index-4]",
